The '''Red Ticket''' was a buyable ticket used for getting [[Toon Skins]] at [[Dandy's Store]] in the Lobby. The cost for 1 Red Ticket was 600 {{TI|Ichor|name=true}}. It used to be the only ticket, but it has been replaced in favor of directly accessing the Skins. Previously, there was a randomized system where players can buy a ticket to a random Skin for 300 Ichor, and if one got 5 duplicates, the next one would guarantee a new one. It was released in [[Changelog|v0.4]], the gacha system was removed in v0.4.1, and tickets were finally removed in v0.6.4.

==Obtainable Skins==
The obtainable Skins with a Red Ticket do not include Vintage Skins. Vintage Skins are obtained by getting 100% [[Mastery]] on a [[Toon]] that the player already own the license to. The Skins that were originally obtainable are:

