==Trivia==
*A Red Ticket used to cost 300 {{TI|Ichor|name=true}} and there was a randomized Gacha System, but that has now been removed, and tickets were changed to 600 Ichor. Players had the ability to pick which Skin they purchased.
**The cost for a Skin of the player's choice used to be 1000 Ichor, this was quickly changed to 600.
*Some Skins were [[scrapped]], including a green Dino Snore {{CI|Shelly|name=true}} Skin, a Dragon Skin for {{CI|Scraps|name=true}}, a Tamagotchi Skin for {{CI|Vee|name=true}}, and a pink and dark purple version of the Lavender Maid {{CI|Tisha|name=true}} Skin.
*The concept art for most of the Skins were drawn by [[Qwel]] on a livestream.
**The ones that weren't showcased before are {{Skin|Rainy Day|toon={{CI|Gigi|name=true}}}}, {{Skin|Thorned Geode|toon={{CI|Pebble|name=true}}}}, and {{Skin|Cutesy Calico|toon=[[Scraps]]}}.
***However, in the Rainy Day and Cutesy Calico textures, it is possible to find its concept art.
****This did not happen with Thorned Geode.
**{{Skin|Special Spaghetti|toon={{CI|Goob|name=true}}}} and {{Skin|Ebony Detective|toon={{CI|Rodger|name=true}}}} were designed by fans; SprinkledFrosting12 and CottonCuteyy respectively.
*In [[Changelog|v0.6.4]], the Skin ticket system was removed, and all Skins were promoted to immediately being seen.

